# USB traces from `s/usb-trace`.
#
# These MUST NOT be committed. A raw capture of the official client contains
# Neural DSP's own strings verbatim, plus this unit's serial number and the
# owner's preset and Neural Capture names - all of it readable. Findings get
# written up in our own words; the bytes stay local. See AGENTS.md, "Legal
# hygiene".
/traces

# Hardware smoke-test fixtures from `s/hardware-smoke`.
#
# MUST NOT be committed - each one records local firmware details from a
# hardware test run.
/smoke-fixtures
